                                                "sense_id": "ad3ccb78-ba5d-307c-aa66-601c56b835d3",
                                                "text": "Venters began to count them—one—two—three—four—on up to sixteen."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "44e9245a-58b8-3bf0-88b9-04d885955412",
                                        "entry_id": "3565d3a5-e8b8-306d-948e-179d36e3e0f4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Describing a set or group with two elements."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b3d14fc0-5990-4f5b-a434-d0ab6e73e68e",
                                                "sense_id": "44e9245a-58b8-3bf0-88b9-04d885955412",
                                                "text": "“[…]The two murders might have been done by one of the ryots who was dissatisfied over his assessment and thought he had a grievance. […].”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "08767cfa-e05a-4c25-9105-daf788b0c11a",
                                                "sense_id": "44e9245a-58b8-3bf0-88b9-04d885955412",
                                                "text": "The surveillance program includes at least 480 LPRs that scan and record about 16.2 million vehicles per week and stores that data for two years, he wrote in the court filing."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
